  "summary": "The codebase is organized into three layers: core (src/core/) owning state and logic, host (src/host/) as a thin RPC router, and webview (src/webview/) for UI. Core includes vendor-agnostic transcript types, per-vendor adapters, a session-channel pub/sub multiplexer, session-manager orchestration, and an activity-index that owns all ~/.crispy/ disk I/O.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
